        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 13752, Interior Simple Narrow Plate Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design with an easy installation, this door lever will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The long plate only adds to its grandeur. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted.  For interior doors with 1-3/8\" thicknesses and either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. It is ADA compliant. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C10PC2_size.gif?v=1704354731\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia 1300 Series Narrow Plate Latch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Simple Lever Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>All critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout.</li>\r\n<li>For commercial and residential use.</li>\r\n<li>For interior use only.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy function features a privacy mortise bolt constructed of a metal case and featuring a solid brass bolt underneath the lever and latch. It has an emergency release on outside plate.</li>\r\n<li>The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. <b>Does Not</b> fit standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Simple Narrow Plate Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-7/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Privacy Function Turnpiece: 1-5/8\" x 1-1/8 proj.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy</b>: For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 1 lever, 1 backplate, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 backplates, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates by lever from either side of door. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, tubular latch, spindle and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Upper latch operates by lever from either side of door. Locks by privacy bolt with turnpiece on inside an emergency release on outside plate. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, spindle, mounting hardware, privacy turnpiece, lever operated tubular latch, and thumbturn operated privacy mortise bolt and case.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-ring-nickel.jpg?v=1704442283\" width=\"170\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Narrow Plate Simple Lever Latchset",
                "description": "Interior Simple Narrow Plate Leverset Omnia 13752 - Simple in design with an easy installation, this door lever will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The long plate only adds to its grandeur. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For interior doors with 1-3/8 inch thicknesses and either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is ADA compliant. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Interior Simple Narrow Plate Leversets, Simple Lever Latchsets, Simple Narrow Plate Levers, OMN-13752, Omnia 13752, omnia narrow plate latchsets, ada levers, passages levers, privacy levers, fancy levers, high end levers, traditional levers,"
